    {
      "uid": "zhcn:202f0d8fed0f8cea83a928b9",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "哎呀……这味道……！\n胡萝卜与混合莓果的\n绝妙融合……！真是人间美味――！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec05aaa7c5ebd82e6338d5e3c5b03f6ccce177b3a4772caf07ba3352ea11053d",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
