      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "还稍微走远了一点――\n为一对在蜜月旅行中闹别扭的夫妇，\n当了一回和事佬。",
      "source_fingerprint": "5031562fc217d90270041597fca76e3dddb6383fcd627d065aaaf43838afafa8",
