      "uid": "zhcn:7ccca192d21af288dcfe6df5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "她真正渴望的，\n是那鲜红、炽热、宛如熊熊烈火般的――",
      "source_fingerprint": "6283c0cd3e53c400cbc8d11a24efdfc39ad2b2550443872adc25345486d3c80f",
